    "chunk_text": "otion Recognition\nAudio emotion recognition using deep learning\n\ninvolves employing advanced neural network techniques to detect and categorize emotions expressed in spoken language. Traditional approaches often depend on manually designed audio features, whereas deep learning methods automatically extract relevant patterns from raw audio signals or their transformed representations. This has led to significant improvements in the performance and generalization of emotion detection systems, with practical uses in areas such as interactive voice assistants\n\n, mental health monitoring, and customer experience analysis especially through sarcasm detection\n.\n\nVisual art processing\nClosely related to the progress that has been made in image reco",
